<title>UK: Kanton Thurgau sets 100 mln Sfr 10-year bond. [CORRECTED 13:16 GMT]</title>
<headline>Kanton Thurgau sets 100 mln Sfr 10-year bond. [CORRECTED 13:16 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects length of bond in headline and text from three- to 10-year.)</p>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KANTON THURGAU</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    12.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    12.FRB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   17.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
